# Internal agent/SOP working files — local only (2026-08-16).
# These carried the author's absolute machine paths into a public,
# forked repo. They are MUSE workflow docs, not project source; the
# canonical copies live in the MUSE repo. Kept on disk, untracked here.
.agent/
.claude/commands/

# Local-only working directories that outlived the 2026-07-29 sweep. Found
# 2026-08-16 by re-running `git ls-files --others` against the CURRENT
# .gitignore instead of the one that sweep started from.
#
# backups/ is the serious one: it holds git bundles of the PRIVATE marketplace
# repository and of this repo's packages. A bundle is an entire repository in a
# single file, so committing one here would publish that private history in
# full, to a public repo with forks, from one `git add -A`.
backups/
# Drafted social posts and their generated slides: internal until published,
# and published from elsewhere when they are.
assets/social/
